UID:liv-team-championship-2026-d1@claude-liv-cal
DTSTAMP:20260727T090000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260827
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260828
SUMMARY:⛳ Aramco LIV Golf Michigan Team Championship
LOCATION:The Cardinal at Saint John's\, 44045 Five Mile Rd\, Plymouth\, M
 I 48170\, USA
GEO:42.393536;-83.478617
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="44045 Five Mile Rd, Plym
 outh, MI 48170, USA";X-APPLE-RADIUS=150;X-TITLE="The Cardinal at Saint J
 ohn's":geo:42.393536,-83.478617
DESCRIPTION:Round 1 - Thursday 27 August 2026\n\nTV\nFOX\, FS1\, FS2\, Fo
 x Business\, LIV Golf app\n\nVenue: The Cardinal at Saint John's\nAddres
 s: 44045 Five Mile Rd\, Plymouth\, MI 48170\, USA\nTournament dates: Thu
  27 Aug - Sun 30 Aug 2026\nPurse: $25M individual + $5M team (approx.)\n
 Event type: LIV Golf - Team Championship\n\nNotes\n*** EXPECTED TO BE CA
 NCELLED - NOT YET OFFICIAL ***\n\nStatus as of Wed 29 July 2026: LIV has
  NOT announced anything. But this is no longer one person's speculation 
 - it was first reported by Tom Hobbs (Flushing It) and then confirmed by
  sources to Front Office Sports\, with Golf Channel\, Yahoo and others c
 arrying it. An official announcement was expected Wednesday.\n\nSupporti
 ng signs: contractors report travel and accommodation cancelled with mon
 ey still owed\; the Detroit News reported no infrastructure had been bui
 lt at the course\; the championship rings reportedly remain unpaid for.\
 n\nBackground: PIF announced in April it would stop funding LIV after th
 is season\, and the money has dried up sooner than expected. LIV is seek
 ing up to $350m from new investors and is working to a 1 September deadl
 ine to fund 2027. This would be the second cancelled event of 2026 after
  Louisiana.\n\nAs scheduled: $40m purse (down from $50m)\, $11.2m to the
  winning team\, at The Cardinal at Saint John's.\n\nTee times confirmed 
 the week of the event - livgolf.com/schedule\nBroadcast listings can cha
 nge.
CATEGORIES:LIV Golf,LIV Golf - Team Championship
URL:https://www.livgolf.com/schedule
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:TENTATIVE
END:VEVENT
